        "line": 29,
        "text": "theorem positive_uniform_margin {K : Set X} (hK : IsCompact K)\n    {g : X → ℝ} (hg : ContinuousOn g K) (hpos : ∀ x ∈ K, 0 < g x) :\n    ∃ ε : ℝ, 0 < ε ∧ ∀ x ∈ K, ε ≤ g x"
